      "body": "Full year 2026 results: EPS: ₹12.44 (down from ₹17.59 in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹2.87b (up 18% from FY 2025). Net income: ₹632.8m (down 24% from FY 2025). Profit margin: 22% (down from 34% in FY 2025). The decrease in margin was driven by higher expenses. Revenue missed analyst estimates by 2.7%. Earnings per share (EPS) exceeded analyst estimates by 16%. Revenue is forecast to grow 45% p.a. on average during the next 2 years, compared to a 16% growth forecast for the Aerospace & Defense industry in India.",
